          "text": "Description: Email testimony from multiple witnesses describing the observation of several lights (approximately 7-8) at 1:15 AM on a Saturday night into Sunday. The main witness does not wish to complete the Geipan-proposed questionnaire or even go to the gendarmerie to make a statement. Any investigation is impossible due to the lack of more precise information. Observation classified C due to lack of information.",
